---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer><div class="container footer-grid"><div><strong>TamaMedics</strong><p>Repair it. Document it. Preserve it. Share it.</p></div><div><p>Open-source tools and community documentation for virtual pet preservation.</p><a href="https://github.com/simplycole/tamamedics.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Project on GitHub</a></div></div><div class="container fine-print">© {year} TamaMedics community. TamaMedics is an independent fan preservation and research project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Bandai.</div></footer>
<style>footer{padding-block:var(--space-7) var(--space-5);border-top:1px solid var(--tm-border);background:rgba(0,0,0,.2)}.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:var(--space-6)}strong{font:900 1.15rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--tm-pink-bright)}p{margin:.4rem 0}.fine-print{margin-top:var(--space-6);padding-top:var(--space-4);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:var(--tm-text-muted);font-size:.78rem}@media(max-width:620px){.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
